      "message": "Right - I can\u0027t think of any situations where writing a serial number to one of these devices would enable testing that couldn\u0027t be done with a normal prod board with serial number.",
      "parentUuid": "10889a6a_88740c60",
      "revId": "f6a39cb60456f911aed5745e79b2f39d833b616c",
