      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-18T16:23:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But that\u0027s assuming that testing only starts with prod boards. Isn\u0027t that a big assumption?",
      "parentUuid": "2c20da3a_faf7d6e3",
      "revId": "f6a39cb60456f911aed5745e79b2f39d833b616c",
