    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "27ce3396_28858687",
        "filename": "chip/g/sn_bits.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 171,
      "author": {
        "id": 1161144
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-18T16:51:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Specifically, what I want to be able to do is to TEST Zero-Touch with a Pre-MP board (assuming DVTs and such early machines are using Pre-MP boards). That TEST will be against the TEST PCA and DMServer. In production, non-MP devices are not allowed to use ZT. In Google3, see https://cs.corp.google.com/piper///depot/google3/java/com/google/wireless/android/enterprise/devicemanagement/chrome/operations/CertificateBasedRegisterDeviceOperation.java?rcl\u003d215474308\u0026l\u003d365 (the flag there is only set to true for the test DMServer).",
      "parentUuid": "33381fa3_e792458d",
      "revId": "f6a39cb60456f911aed5745e79b2f39d833b616c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d280ff2c_ff2fb56f",
        "filename": "chip/g/sn_bits.c",
